  <element>
    <id>Text</id>
    <coordinates><x>0</x><y>0</y><w>1200</w><h>30</h></coordinates>
    <panel_attributes>Context map: four bounded contexts and their integration patterns (spec-01 s1.5, spec-03 s0)</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes/>
  </element>
  <element>
    <id>UMLPackage</id>
    <coordinates><x>40</x><y>60</y><w>400</w><h>200</h></coordinates>
    <panel_attributes>Inventory &amp; Batch
--
inventory-service :8081  |  Domain Model
Product = a physical batch with expiry and cost
StockBatch &lt;&lt;AR&gt;&gt;, FefoDeductionPolicy
Owns: batches, expiry, stock levels
Sub-domain: supporting
bg=#DDEBF7
halign=left</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes/>
  </element>
  <element>
    <id>UMLPackage</id>
    <coordinates><x>760</x><y>60</y><w>400</w><h>200</h></coordinates>
    <panel_attributes>Insight
--
insight-service :8084  |  CQRS read side (ADR 0006)
Materialised views and agent traces
SkuVelocityView, BatchRiskView, AgentTraceRecord
Markdown Decision Agent, Briefing Agent
Sub-domain: core (expiry risk, markdown decision)
bg=#FFF2CC
halign=left</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes/>
  </element>
  <element>
    <id>UMLPackage</id>
    <coordinates><x>40</x><y>500</y><w>400</w><h>200</h></coordinates>
    <panel_attributes>Sales
--
sales-service :8082  |  Transaction Script
Product = a SKU with the price at scan time
SaleTransaction, LineItem, PriceSnapshot
Owns: transactions, price application
Sub-domain: generic
bg=#E2F0D9
halign=left</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes/>
  </element>
  <element>
    <id>UMLPackage</id>
    <coordinates><x>760</x><y>500</y><w>400</w><h>200</h></coordinates>
    <panel_attributes>Pricing &amp; Markdown
--
pricing-service :8083  |  Domain Model
Product = cost and margin constraints
MarkdownPlan &lt;&lt;AR&gt;&gt;, PriceRule, MarginFloorPolicy
Owns: price rules, markdown plans, margin floor
Sub-domain: core (markdown decision, margin floor)
bg=#FCE5CD
halign=left</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes/>
  </element>
  <element>
    <id>UMLPackage</id>
    <coordinates><x>480</x><y>320</y><w>240</w><h>110</h></coordinates>
    <panel_attributes>contracts
--
Published Language
integration events (Table A)
eventId + occurredAt on every event
bg=#F2F2F2
halign=left</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes/>
  </element>
