  <element>
    <id>UMLNote</id>
    <coordinates><x>40</x><y>740</y><w>1120</w><h>70</h></coordinates>
    <panel_attributes>Sub-domains: core = expiry risk detection and markdown decision (Insight, Pricing); supporting = batch inventory tracking, price-rule maintenance; generic = sale
transaction recording. No shared kernel: Money, Sku and Quantity are re-declared per context; the only shared artefact is the contracts module (spec-03 s6).
bg=#FFFBE6</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes/>
  </element>
  <element>
    <id>UMLNote</id>
    <coordinates><x>480</x><y>440</y><w>240</w><h>50</h></coordinates>
    <panel_attributes>Synchronous REST is used only
for agent tool calls (spec-01 s1.3).
bg=#FFFBE6</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes/>
  </element>
